{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.993,"lines":[{"text":"Aujourd’hui, j’ai pas trop envie de parler,","t":3.68,"e":5.98,"w":[["Aujourd’hui",3.68,4.12],["j’ai",4.18,4.32],["pas",4.38,4.5],["trop",4.56,4.76],["envie",4.76,5.06],["de",5.1,5.22],["parler",5.34,5.98]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ne le prends pas mal, j’ai juste besoin de respirer.","t":8.86,"e":11.62,"w":[["Ne",8.86,8.96],["le",9.04,9.12],["prends",9.18,9.38],["pas",9.42,9.56],["mal",9.66,9.88],["j’ai",9.94,10.08],["juste",10.12,10.28],["besoin",10.34,10.64],["de",10.7,10.78],["respirer",10.86,11.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"De fermer un peu la porte au bruit du monde,","t":13.72,"e":16.82,"w":[["De",13.72,13.8],["fermer",13.9,14.32],["un",14.4,14.54],["peu",14.62,14.86],["la",14.94,15.04],["porte",15.18,15.5],["au",15.54,15.62],["bruit",15.68,15.88],["du",15.92,16.08],["monde",16.22,16.82]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Et d’écouter mes pensées quelques secondes…","t":19.52,"e":23.6,"w":[["Et",19.52,19.62],["d’écouter",19.66,20.4],["mes",20.92,21.1],["pensées",21.16,21.78],["quelques",21.88,22.44],["secondes",22.58,23.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai besoin de passer du temps avec moi-même,","t":33.66,"e":35.92,"w":[["J’ai",33.66,33.82],["besoin",33.88,34.18],["de",34.24,34.32],["passer",34.4,34.72],["du",34.78,34.88],["temps",34.94,35.12],["avec",35.22,35.44],["moi-même",35.48,35.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"De retrouver celui que j’étais, celui que j’aime.","t":36.2,"e":38.82,"w":[["De",36.2,36.28],["retrouver",36.34,36.82],["celui",36.88,37.18],["que",37.24,37.34],["j’étais",37.38,37.84],["celui",37.94,38.24],["que",38.3,38.42],["j’aime",38.46,38.82]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ces derniers temps, j’ai couru sans regarder,","t":39.36,"e":41.46,"w":[["Ces",39.36,39.48],["derniers",39.54,39.86],["temps",39.9,40.02],["j’ai",40.06,40.2],["couru",40.28,40.56],["sans",40.62,40.78],["regarder",40.82,41.46]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les rêves abandonnés, les promesses oubliées.","t":41.52,"e":44.42,"w":[["Les",41.52,41.62],["rêves",41.7,41.9],["abandonnés",42.12,42.86],["les",42.92,43],["promesses",43.06,43.62],["oubliées",43.68,44.42]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai souri pour rassurer ceux qui m’entouraient,","t":44.68,"e":46.92,"w":[["J’ai",44.68,44.8],["souri",44.88,45.18],["pour",45.26,45.4],["rassurer",45.42,45.86],["ceux",45.94,46.06],["qui",46.12,46.24],["m’entouraient",46.28,46.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Même quand, au fond de moi, tout s’écroulait.","t":47.86,"e":49.74,"w":[["Même",47.86,48.02],["quand",48.06,48.22],["au",48.24,48.32],["fond",48.4,48.54],["de",48.6,48.68],["moi",48.74,48.88],["tout",48.94,49.04],["s’écroulait",49.12,49.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai répondu « ça va » pour éviter les questions,","t":50,"e":52.64,"w":[["J’ai",50,50.12],["répondu",50.18,50.64],["ça",50.72,50.86],["va",50.92,51.06],["pour",51.12,51.26],["éviter",51.36,51.76],["les",51.8,51.92],["questions",51.98,52.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais aujourd’hui, je veux entendre mes émotions.","t":52.86,"e":55.66,"w":[["Mais",52.86,53],["aujourd’hui",53.06,53.54],["je",53.92,54.02],["veux",54.08,54.2],["entendre",54.26,54.6],["mes",54.64,54.8],["émotions",54.88,55.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ce n’est pas contre vous si je prends mes distances,","t":56.4,"e":58.98,"w":[["Ce",56.4,56.5],["n’est",56.56,56.7],["pas",56.74,56.86],["contre",56.92,57.24],["vous",57.3,57.4],["si",57.46,57.56],["je",57.62,57.74],["prends",57.8,57.98],["mes",58.04,58.28],["distances",58.36,58.98]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai simplement rendez-vous avec ma conscience.","t":59.02,"e":61.92,"w":[["J’ai",59.02,59.16],["simplement",59.22,59.7],["rendez-vous",59.78,60.34],["avec",60.54,60.82],["ma",60.88,61.1],["conscience",61.2,61.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Avant de continuer cette longue traversée,","t":62,"e":64.56,"w":[["Avant",62,62.22],["de",62.26,62.38],["continuer",62.42,63.08],["cette",63.18,63.44],["longue",63.5,63.76],["traversée",63.82,64.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai besoin de savoir où mes pas m’ont mené.","t":64.9,"e":67.52,"w":[["J’ai",64.9,65.04],["besoin",65.08,65.4],["de",65.44,65.54],["savoir",65.62,66],["où",66.02,66.1],["mes",66.16,66.32],["pas",66.38,66.62],["m’ont",66.68,66.82],["mené",66.88,67.52]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Laissez-moi seul avec mes pensées,","t":67.92,"e":70.34,"w":[["Laissez-moi",67.92,68.52],["seul",68.66,69],["avec",69.1,69.46],["mes",69.5,69.64],["pensées",69.72,70.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai toute une vie à réorganiser.","t":70.58,"e":73,"w":[["J’ai",70.58,70.72],["toute",70.78,70.96],["une",71.04,71.26],["vie",71.32,71.66],["à",71.74,71.8],["réorganiser",71.86,73]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Faire le bilan de mes défaites, de mes victoires,","t":73.08,"e":75.86,"w":[["Faire",73.08,73.22],["le",73.28,73.38],["bilan",73.44,73.74],["de",73.8,73.9],["mes",73.96,74.1],["défaites",74.14,74.64],["de",74.68,74.78],["mes",74.84,75],["victoires",75.06,75.86]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Des portes refermées, des nouveaux départs.","t":76.28,"e":79.24,"w":[["Des",76.28,76.4],["portes",76.46,76.66],["refermées",76.68,77.3],["des",77.36,77.46],["nouveaux",77.52,77.86],["départs",77.9,79.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Laissez-moi seul, juste un petit moment,","t":79.28,"e":81.74,"w":[["Laissez-moi",79.28,79.78],["seul",79.98,80.26],["juste",80.36,80.54],["un",80.6,80.68],["petit",80.72,81.02],["moment",81.1,81.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Pour regarder ma vie autrement.","t":82.34,"e":84.52,"w":[["Pour",82.34,82.48],["regarder",82.5,82.98],["ma",83.06,83.32],["vie",83.38,83.58],["autrement",83.66,84.52]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je ne veux pas fuir, je veux me retrouver,","t":84.8,"e":87.42,"w":[["Je",84.8,84.9],["ne",84.96,85.08],["veux",85.14,85.3],["pas",85.36,85.56],["fuir",85.66,85.96],["je",86.04,86.16],["veux",86.2,86.34],["me",86.4,86.52],["retrouver",86.58,87.42]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Pour revenir plus fort… et mieux avancer.","t":87.66,"e":90.24,"w":[["Pour",87.66,87.82],["revenir",87.84,88.3],["plus",88.34,88.5],["fort",88.66,89.02],["et",89.08,89.16],["mieux",89.22,89.4],["avancer",89.52,90.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Côté travail, ai-je vraiment progressé ?","t":90.66,"e":92.94,"w":[["Côté",90.66,90.96],["travail",91,91.7],["ai-je",91.74,91.86],["vraiment",91.88,92.18],["progressé",92.22,92.94]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ou suis-je seulement devenu plus fatigué ?","t":93.32,"e":95.78,"w":[["Ou",93.32,93.4],["suis-je",93.46,93.76],["seulement",93.86,94.34],["devenu",94.4,94.84],["plus",94.88,95.02],["fatigué",95.1,95.78]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’avais des ambitions plus grandes que mes peurs,","t":96.14,"e":98.74,"w":[["J’avais",96.14,96.46],["des",96.5,96.68],["ambitions",96.72,97.32],["plus",97.4,97.52],["grandes",97.58,97.88],["que",97.92,98.04],["mes",98.1,98.3],["peurs",98.46,98.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais parfois les obligations étouffent le cœur.","t":98.82,"e":101.64,"w":[["Mais",98.82,98.94],["parfois",98.98,99.32],["les",99.36,99.52],["obligations",99.58,100.38],["étouffent",100.5,100.92],["le",100.96,101.12],["cœur",101.3,101.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Côté famille, ai-je été assez présent ?","t":102.02,"e":104.28,"w":[["Côté",102.02,102.32],["famille",102.4,102.9],["ai-je",102.96,103.1],["été",103.18,103.42],["assez",103.48,103.72],["présent",103.76,104.28]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ai-je donné de l’amour ou seulement de mon temps ?","t":104.5,"e":107.22,"w":[["Ai-je",104.5,104.66],["donné",104.7,104.98],["de",105.04,105.14],["l’amour",105.2,105.74],["ou",105.76,105.82],["seulement",105.9,106.4],["de",106.46,106.56],["mon",106.64,106.9],["temps",107,107.22]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Combien de « je t’aime » sont restés dans ma tête ?","t":107.52,"e":110.08,"w":[["Combien",107.52,107.82],["de",107.88,107.96],["je",108.02,108.2],["t’aime",108.38,108.68],["sont",108.74,108.9],["restés",108.94,109.24],["dans",109.28,109.42],["ma",109.48,109.62],["tête",109.84,110.08]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Combien de pardons attendent encore d’être honnêtes ?","t":110.38,"e":113.02,"w":[["Combien",110.38,110.68],["de",110.72,110.8],["pardons",110.9,111.42],["attendent",111.5,111.78],["encore",111.8,112.08],["d’être",112.12,112.36],["honnêtes",112.38,113.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Côté amour, qu’est-ce qu’il reste de moi ?","t":113.36,"e":115.66,"w":[["Côté",113.36,113.7],["amour",113.8,114.3],["qu’est-ce",114.4,114.58],["qu’il",114.62,114.74],["reste",114.78,115.1],["de",115.18,115.3],["moi",115.5,115.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Des souvenirs qui reviennent quand le silence est là.","t":115.86,"e":118.5,"w":[["Des",115.86,115.96],["souvenirs",116.02,116.36],["qui",116.38,116.52],["reviennent",116.58,117.08],["quand",117.1,117.24],["le",117.28,117.38],["silence",117.46,117.98],["est",118.04,118.28],["là",118.36,118.5]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai aimé avec mes forces et mes blessures,","t":119.02,"e":121.62,"w":[["J’ai",119.02,119.22],["aimé",119.3,119.56],["avec",119.7,120.04],["mes",120.08,120.22],["forces",120.34,120.64],["et",120.66,120.76],["mes",120.82,120.94],["blessures",120.98,121.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Cherchant l’éternité dans des choses peu sûres.","t":121.68,"e":124.4,"w":[["Cherchant",121.68,122.02],["l’éternité",122.06,122.9],["dans",122.96,123.1],["des",123.14,123.28],["choses",123.32,123.62],["peu",123.68,123.84],["sûres",124.06,124.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Et mes amis, sont-ils encore sur mon chemin ?","t":124.44,"e":127.02,"w":[["Et",124.44,124.5],["mes",124.56,124.72],["amis",124.78,125.02],["sont-ils",125.08,125.46],["encore",125.52,125.9],["sur",125.98,126.14],["mon",126.2,126.4],["chemin",126.44,127.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ou seulement des visages croisés de loin ?","t":127.78,"e":129.86,"w":[["Ou",127.78,127.84],["seulement",127.9,128.24],["des",128.3,128.42],["visages",128.46,128.78],["croisés",128.82,129.32],["de",129.38,129.52],["loin",129.64,129.86]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Certains sont partis quand le ciel s’est couvert,","t":130.04,"e":132.84,"w":[["Certains",130.04,130.5],["sont",130.58,130.74],["partis",130.8,131.4],["quand",131.46,131.6],["le",131.66,131.74],["ciel",131.82,132.1],["s’est",132.18,132.32],["couvert",132.36,132.84]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"D’autres ont tenu ma main au milieu de l’hiver.","t":132.9,"e":135.64,"w":[["D’autres",132.9,133.1],["ont",133.1,133.2],["tenu",133.28,133.56],["ma",133.64,133.84],["main",133.94,134.04],["au",134.04,134.22],["milieu",134.32,134.78],["de",134.86,134.98],["l’hiver",135.04,135.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je ne cherche ni coupable ni justification,","t":135.72,"e":138.48,"w":[["Je",135.72,135.84],["ne",135.9,136],["cherche",136.08,136.4],["ni",136.46,136.56],["coupable",136.62,137.1],["ni",137.16,137.28],["justification",137.34,138.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je veux seulement comprendre ma direction.","t":138.76,"e":141.3,"w":[["Je",138.76,138.86],["veux",138.9,139.04],["seulement",139.1,139.58],["comprendre",139.66,140.32],["ma",140.36,140.5],["direction",140.56,141.3]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Car avancer sans savoir où l’on veut aller,","t":141.42,"e":144.04,"w":[["Car",141.42,141.6],["avancer",141.7,142.06],["sans",142.12,142.26],["savoir",142.32,142.8],["où",142.88,142.98],["l’on",143.02,143.3],["veut",143.36,143.52],["aller",143.64,144.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"C’est courir très vite… mais tourner sans arrêt.","t":144.42,"e":147.06,"w":[["C’est",144.42,144.52],["courir",144.58,144.9],["très",144.96,145.24],["vite",145.3,145.56],["mais",145.68,145.8],["tourner",145.86,146.16],["sans",146.22,146.42],["arrêt",146.5,147.06]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Laissez-moi seul avec mes pensées,","t":147.44,"e":149.82,"w":[["Laissez-moi",147.44,148.04],["seul",148.18,148.52],["avec",148.62,148.98],["mes",149.04,149.18],["pensées",149.24,149.82]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai toute une vie à réorganiser.","t":150.1,"e":152.52,"w":[["J’ai",150.1,150.24],["toute",150.3,150.48],["une",150.58,150.8],["vie",150.86,151.16],["à",151.26,151.3],["réorganiser",151.38,152.52]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Faire le bilan de mes défaites, de mes victoires,","t":152.6,"e":155.38,"w":[["Faire",152.6,152.74],["le",152.8,152.9],["bilan",152.96,153.28],["de",153.32,153.42],["mes",153.48,153.62],["défaites",153.66,154.14],["de",154.2,154.3],["mes",154.36,154.52],["victoires",154.58,155.38]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Des portes refermées, des nouveaux départs.","t":155.82,"e":158.76,"w":[["Des",155.82,155.92],["portes",155.98,156.16],["refermées",156.2,156.82],["des",156.86,156.98],["nouveaux",157.04,157.36],["départs",157.42,158.76]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Laissez-moi seul, juste un petit moment,","t":158.8,"e":161.24,"w":[["Laissez-moi",158.8,159.34],["seul",159.5,159.76],["juste",159.86,160.04],["un",160.1,160.18],["petit",160.24,160.52],["moment",160.6,161.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Pour regarder ma vie autrement.","t":161.86,"e":164.02,"w":[["Pour",161.86,161.98],["regarder",162.02,162.5],["ma",162.58,162.82],["vie",162.88,163.08],["autrement",163.16,164.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je ne veux pas fuir, je veux me retrouver,","t":164.32,"e":166.88,"w":[["Je",164.32,164.4],["ne",164.48,164.6],["veux",164.66,164.8],["pas",164.86,165.08],["fuir",165.18,165.48],["je",165.54,165.66],["veux",165.7,165.84],["me",165.9,166.02],["retrouver",166.08,166.88]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Pour revenir plus fort… et mieux avancer.","t":167.18,"e":169.6,"w":[["Pour",167.18,167.3],["revenir",167.36,167.8],["plus",167.86,167.98],["fort",168.14,168.5],["et",168.56,168.66],["mieux",168.72,168.9],["avancer",169,169.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Est-ce que l’enfant que j’étais serait fier de l’homme que je suis ?","t":169.64,"e":173.3,"w":[["Est-ce",169.64,169.78],["que",169.8,169.92],["l’enfant",169.96,170.3],["que",170.34,170.44],["j’étais",170.48,170.98],["serait",171.08,171.36],["fier",171.44,171.72],["de",171.78,171.9],["l’homme",171.92,172.26],["que",172.32,172.44],["je",172.66,172.78],["suis",172.96,173.3]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Est-ce que mes rêves respirent encore aujourd’hui ?","t":173.52,"e":176,"w":[["Est-ce",173.52,173.66],["que",173.7,173.8],["mes",173.86,174],["rêves",174.04,174.22],["respirent",174.26,174.58],["encore",174.64,175.14],["aujourd’hui",175.2,176]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ai-je construit ma route ou suivi celle des autres ?","t":176.24,"e":179.04,"w":[["Ai-je",176.24,176.48],["construit",176.54,176.84],["ma",176.9,177.04],["route",177.12,177.44],["ou",177.46,177.54],["suivi",177.58,177.92],["celle",178,178.28],["des",178.34,178.54],["autres",178.58,179.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ai-je porté mes choix… ou seulement porté leurs fautes ?","t":179.08,"e":181.8,"w":[["Ai-je",179.08,179.32],["porté",179.36,179.66],["mes",179.72,179.84],["choix",179.86,180.24],["ou",180.3,180.36],["seulement",180.44,180.78],["porté",180.84,181.16],["leurs",181.2,181.46],["fautes",181.54,181.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai peut-être perdu du temps, mais pas mon avenir,","t":181.86,"e":184.48,"w":[["J’ai",181.86,182.02],["peut-être",182.06,182.38],["perdu",182.42,182.72],["du",182.78,182.88],["temps",182.98,183.18],["mais",183.3,183.44],["pas",183.5,183.62],["mon",183.66,183.84],["avenir",183.92,184.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Il reste encore des pages et des choses à bâtir.","t":184.58,"e":187.32,"w":[["Il",184.58,184.66],["reste",184.72,184.9],["encore",184.96,185.38],["des",185.42,185.58],["pages",185.64,185.98],["et",186.02,186.08],["des",186.14,186.24],["choses",186.3,186.68],["à",186.72,186.78],["bâtir",186.84,187.32]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mes cicatrices ne racontent pas seulement mes douleurs,","t":187.36,"e":190.2,"w":[["Mes",187.36,187.48],["cicatrices",187.54,188.06],["ne",188.1,188.2],["racontent",188.24,188.58],["pas",188.64,188.78],["seulement",188.96,189.42],["mes",189.5,189.64],["douleurs",189.7,190.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Elles prouvent que j’ai survécu à plusieurs heures sombres.","t":190.24,"e":193.28,"w":[["Elles",190.24,190.34],["prouvent",190.38,190.7],["que",190.74,190.84],["j’ai",190.88,191.02],["survécu",191.08,191.8],["à",191.88,191.96],["plusieurs",192,192.52],["heures",192.56,192.8],["sombres",192.88,193.28]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Alors laissez-moi seul avec mes pensées,","t":193.38,"e":196.4,"w":[["Alors",193.38,193.58],["laissez-moi",194.3,194.84],["seul",195,195.22],["avec",195.3,195.52],["mes",195.56,195.68],["pensées",195.74,196.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ce soir, j’ai besoin de tout recommencer.","t":196.96,"e":199.08,"w":[["Ce",196.96,197.06],["soir",197.12,197.28],["j’ai",197.32,197.46],["besoin",197.5,197.82],["de",197.88,197.98],["tout",198.04,198.16],["recommencer",198.22,199.08]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Faire la paix avec mes erreurs, avec mon histoire,","t":199.6,"e":202.26,"w":[["Faire",199.6,199.76],["la",199.82,199.94],["paix",200,200.14],["avec",200.28,200.48],["mes",200.52,200.68],["erreurs",200.76,201.06],["avec",201.16,201.36],["mon",201.4,201.58],["histoire",201.62,202.26]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Et rallumer doucement la lumière dans le noir.","t":202.34,"e":204.92,"w":[["Et",202.34,202.4],["rallumer",202.46,202.98],["doucement",203.04,203.48],["la",203.56,203.66],["lumière",203.72,204.16],["dans",204.22,204.38],["le",204.42,204.52],["noir",204.58,204.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Laissez-moi seul, mais ne vous inquiétez pas,","t":205.16,"e":207.4,"w":[["Laissez-moi",205.16,205.66],["seul",205.8,205.98],["mais",206.04,206.16],["ne",206.2,206.32],["vous",206.38,206.54],["inquiétez",206.6,207.06],["pas",207.16,207.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je prends simplement du recul sur mes pas.","t":207.62,"e":210.24,"w":[["Je",207.62,207.74],["prends",207.78,208.08],["simplement",208.16,208.82],["du",208.88,208.98],["recul",209.04,209.48],["sur",209.54,209.7],["mes",209.76,209.9],["pas",209.98,210.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je ne disparais pas, j’apprends à me retrouver,","t":210.3,"e":213,"w":[["Je",210.3,210.4],["ne",210.46,210.58],["disparais",210.64,211.12],["pas",211.18,211.4],["j’apprends",211.5,211.88],["à",211.96,212.02],["me",212.08,212.18],["retrouver",212.24,213]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Car parfois, il faut s’arrêter… pour mieux avancer.","t":213.1,"e":216.64,"w":[["Car",213.1,213.24],["parfois",213.3,213.74],["il",214.02,214.12],["faut",214.18,214.32],["s’arrêter",214.38,215.38],["pour",215.44,215.56],["mieux",215.62,215.78],["avancer",215.9,216.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aujourd’hui, je n’ai pas trop envie de parler…","t":219.46,"e":221.96,"w":[["Aujourd’hui",219.46,219.8],["je",219.86,220],["n’ai",220.04,220.16],["pas",220.22,220.34],["trop",220.38,220.6],["envie",220.8,221.06],["de",221.1,221.24],["parler",221.32,221.96]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’ai besoin d’écouter ce que mon cœur veut raconter.","t":223.9,"e":227.66,"w":[["J’ai",223.9,224.06],["besoin",224.12,224.42],["d’écouter",224.46,225.16],["ce",225.72,225.82],["que",225.88,226.02],["mon",226.08,226.22],["cœur",226.3,226.56],["veut",226.64,226.76],["raconter",226.8,227.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le silence n’est pas toujours un signe de faiblesse,","t":229.44,"e":232.24,"w":[["Le",229.44,229.54],["silence",229.64,230.06],["n’est",230.1,230.24],["pas",230.3,230.46],["toujours",230.52,230.86],["un",230.92,231.04],["signe",231.16,231.4],["de",231.46,231.56],["faiblesse",231.66,232.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Parfois, c’est l’âme qui se répare… en toute discrétion.","t":233.9,"e":239.34,"w":[["Parfois",233.9,234.3],["c’est",235.96,236.08],["l’âme",236.14,236.44],["qui",236.5,236.6],["se",236.66,236.76],["répare",236.8,237.24],["en",238.16,238.26],["toute",238.32,238.48],["discrétion",238.56,239.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Marco on the Beat…","t":241.16,"e":245.58,"w":[["Marco",241.16,241.68],["on",242.92,243.12],["the",244.15,244.35],["Beat",245.38,245.58]],"ok":0.25},{"text":"Ce soir, je fais le point…","t":246.62,"e":249.28,"w":[["Ce",246.62,246.74],["soir",246.82,247.16],["je",248.4,248.52],["fais",248.6,248.74],["le",248.78,248.88],["point",248.96,249.28]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Demain, je reprends le chemin.","t":251.77,"e":255.7,"w":[["Demain",251.77,251.97],["je",254.26,254.42],["reprends",254.48,254.96],["le",255.02,255.1],["chemin",255.16,255.7]],"ok":0.8}]}